03721102851", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821702_1369203724436184_4559676736254003479_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-kv8eFpcleUQ7kNvwFmtRbD&_nc_oc=Adr_OeO7Yro67NK_eWIsJXiWUnOgzoLRpy6nfWfByY1jbNDwqou4odOBBKP5GPQwV5E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTD37araZcq-8JWc-TovBuZH8CGk2nF4HA6_YoLXZNNCQ&oe=6AF33683"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1448102076650436", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1448102079983769_3748244163527432021_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OncSm8ME1xAQ7kNvwGgdGyd&_nc_oc=AdoxXqhrd9RO7Q0YQtohhTrc4wnawiCduIMFg4G-3JUUdmjoRjQ1nOgIwB4FlWFqHYE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSieh-oDufk4kcTysK6MSt_NQ82MNZN_joXJLgchWwOqA&oe=6AF359B2"}, {"file_name": "8.png", "id": "2289497311528739", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_2289497318195405_5073854514587253533_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TWR1ax_-2ScQ7kNvwEn0Xgx&_nc_oc=AdqlRJy7cMHw6MJMgwpzmaT0_zoOnfWFDXaaXAdW1TMoKo79qSQ0m3upkRQdmOfu3Ro&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSl9uHCDEjbZX4pgM5ExwuwiQs1unQHC_NZKABFrpIs7w&oe=6AF3576D"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2715541525449181", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821719_2715541528782514_5169867024946638943_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tc7bep73kjUQ7kNvwFeU5mF&_nc_oc=Ador_QTHVbIsock9QjapFLT8iBIPDmhSoorODpHU4y0S5nv-DscqI9ZZ0UOeszkN274&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQn_c_ffadUflGVd64390MXhmDruwQJ5HMaiDWicTzEGA&oe=6AF32DE1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Virtual Mechatronics Lab", "keywords": ["mechatronics"], "long_description": "Unlock the full potential of Industry 4.0 with our comprehensive Cyber-Physical Factory (CPF) platform. This is not just automation; it is a total synchronization of the physical and virtual worlds.\n\nIn a traditional setup, machines operate in silos. In our Cyber-Physical Factory, every asset is part of a living, breathing network. By fusing mechanical components with advanced software logic, we provide a \"System of Systems\" that evolves with your business needs.\n\nKey Pillars of the Ecosystem:\nThe Digital Twin Integration: Every physical machine has a virtual counterpart. Simulate new production workflows or stress-test your line in a risk-free digital environment before ever touching the shop floor.\n\nAutonomous Orchestration: Utilizing decentralized logic, workstations communicate with one another to reroute tasks, balance loads, and self-correct for errors without requiring constant human intervention.\n\nEdge-to-Cloud Connectivity: High-speed sensors capture thousands of data points per second. This data is processed at the \"edge\" for instant reactions and sent to the cloud for long-term strategic analysis.\n\nInteroperability: Our framework supports standard industrial protocols (OPC UA, MQTT), ensuring that legacy hardware and modern robotics work together in one unified interface.\n\nOperational Benefits:\nZero-Downtime Strategy: AI-driven predictive maintenance identifies wear and tear in components like bearings or motors, scheduling service only when necessary.", "short_description": "Transform manufacturing with the ultimate Cyber-Physical Factory ecosystem. This solution bridges the gap between physical hardware and digital intelligence. By integrating IoT sensors, robotics, and real-time data analytics, our system creates a self-optimizing production environment. Monitor your entire floor through a high-fidelity Digital Twin, predict maintenance needs before failures occur, and achieve unprecedented flexibility in \"Batch Size 1\" production. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vml.dkut.ac.ke/docs/Virtual%20Mechatronics%20Lab.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url":